Translated Content 2:
"My name is Nunua, brother, an exile from Chieli,"
Lied Zviadauri, hiding his name.
What could he do? They knew his name;
He had made many Kists owe him blood;
He had cut off the right hands of many Kists,
And sent them prematurely to the grave.

