Translated Content 22:
– Should I follow?! What are you saying, you shallow-minded? They will not let me near!
I must fight alone, so the whole host may see me;
Let the world see who is loyal and who is not.
The Kists think me a traitor, turned away from my own faith;
They think that Joqola sold himself for money,
That I am a betrayer of Kisteti, having forsaken my soul;
They bring a gravestone and place it upon my heart while I am yet alive.

Translated Content 11:
They were met by the Kist army too, hidden along the edges of the ravines;
They fired their rifles, flintlocks bound with iron bands;
They do not yield the way to the agile Khevsur youths.
From both sides they fire their guns with fierce war cries,
Both are troubled by the cause, both fight with steadfastness.
The bullet drank blood in plenty, – it grazed the mountain grass,
Yet the Kists did not break, they stand like a fortress-tower.
Baburauli advised the Khevsurs to descend sword-to-sword.
The matter came to the sword, the shield gave way to the hacking;
The Khevsurs have a dear treasure and booty to reclaim.
O shield, do not fail the Gorda sword, you are its kin;
Before the Khevsurs running downhill, a rocky ledge appeared.

Translated Content 0:
The wind beats, shouting down through the valleys from the mountains;
A woman stands, looking down at the river, on a cliff, with her hair spread;
She reminds me of a light-deprived star with pale, trembling lips.
She makes no sound… startled she trembles, as she gazes down at the river;
How dreadfully it roars, how dreadfully it flows!
Grimacing and cruel, the black valley rages,
“Do not kill yourself!” if only one would advise her so.
The woman closed her eyes, and quickly plunged into the whirlpool.

Translated Content 2:
The wind beats, howling down through the ravines from the mountains;
A woman stands, gazing at the river from the cliff, with hair unbound;
She reminds me of a star shorn of its rays, with pale, trembling lips.
She makes no sound… startled she shudders, looking down at the river;
How dreadfully it roars, how dreadfully it flows!
The grimacing, fierce black valley rages,
"Do not kill yourself!"—if only one would advise her so.
The woman closed her eyes, and swiftly cast herself into the whirlpool.

Translated Content 3:
